%% Successful schema-v1 JSON load sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Codec as CodecBoundary
  participant Import as Schema v1 import events
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Interaction as InteractionEngine
  participant Cleanup as PointerToolCleanupCoordinator
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  Caller->>API: loadDocumentFromJson(json)
  API->>Runtime: delegate schema-v1 JSON load
  Runtime->>Runtime: reject disposed or guarded runtime before mutation

  Runtime->>Codec: parse and validate schema-v1 JSON
  Codec->>Codec: check raw length, JSON shape, schemaVersion 1, known fields, metadata, enums, and transforms
  Codec->>Import: emit dependency-neutral document, resource, layer, and element events
  Note over Codec,Import: Codec does not construct CanvasDocument, CanvasImageResource, store rows, or a retained validated graph.

  Import-->>Store: event stream
  Runtime->>Store: prepare schema-v1 store import from current revisions
  Store->>Store: build resource descriptor rows, family rows, layer order, ids, references, revisions, and camera facts
  Store-->>Runtime: PreparedStoreDocumentImport
  Note over Runtime,Store: No interaction interrupt, selection clear, cache eviction, repaint, state publication, or projection build occurs before preparation succeeds.

  Runtime->>Interaction: prepare successful load cleanup
  Interaction->>Cleanup: typed prepared-load cleanup request
  Cleanup-->>Interaction: LoadInteractionCleanupOutcome
  Interaction-->>Runtime: preview cleanup facts prepared before install

  Runtime->>Store: install prepared store rows atomically
  Store->>Store: replace committed tables and id admission
  Store-->>Runtime: installed revisions and persisted camera facts
  Runtime->>Selection: clear selection in same accepted result
  Selection-->>Runtime: selection revision facts
  Runtime->>Runtime: initialize runtime view camera from installed persisted camera
  Runtime->>Runtime: increment epoch and viewCamera revisions

  Store->>Projection: invalidate public projection without building it
  Runtime->>Spatial: rebuild replacement spatial index from committed rows
  Runtime->>Resources: invalidate descriptor-backed resource visuals
  Runtime->>Frame: reset replacement-scoped caches and schedule repaint
  Runtime->>Signals: publish one CanvasRuntimeState after install
  Note over Signals: JSON load emits no CanvasActionCommitted event and does not build the first CanvasDocument projection.

  Runtime-->>API: complete
  API-->>Caller: return after accepted state/effect delivery
